              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Heather Houk"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent! I used 2 cloves pressed garlic instead of the garlic powder and marinated pork loin chops for 24 hours. Wonderful results.",
            "datePublished": "2004-03-16T19:39:45.827Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
