            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pastorgerri"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is now my go-to marinade for many kinds of meat. I especially like using it for London Broil on the grill. Once we got invited to dinner at the last minute and I left the meat in the marinade until the next day. It was soooo good that now I always try to put all the ingredients in a gallon zip bag, then add the meat and refrigerate the day before I cook it.",
